{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/693408-need-ideas-for-rank-challenge-philodox-rank-2-to-3","id":693408,"title":"need ideas for rank challenge / philodox rank 2 to 3","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-07T20:38:10-07:00","id":693408,"title":"need ideas for rank challenge / philodox rank 2 to 3","content":"What are some good ideas for a Challenge for a Philodox Fostern to become Adren? I need some ideas. Thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-08T01:03:35-07:00","id":693542,"title":"","content":"Could you tell me more about the character who needs the challenge? Also about the local Caern and what their problems are right now? This is something that could use a bit of context. Obvious options seem to be arbitration between two packs, a contest of law reciting, hunting down a rogue cub that refused to take its place among the other Garou, finding out who stole a fetish, investigating the strange disappearance of a a Garou/kin...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-08T06:50:31-07:00","id":693823,"title":"","content":"Without the specific details of what is happening at the local Caern and the politics involved it is hard to give a really tailored challenge. Asmodai gave a nice set of challenges that are general enough to cover a wide range of options.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/293-lncbill","name":"lncbill","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar293_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-08T08:40:03-07:00","id":693884,"title":"","content":"One task that could also work is going to another sept to solve a dispute/issue. It would test the Philodox's ability to take charge and find out information without their typical information network.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-08T19:53:57-07:00","id":694452,"title":"","content":"It's actually an NPC. I'm about to describe a moot and wanted to include an NPC challenging for rank to give the players an idea of what it will be like when they are ready to challenge (from Cliath to Fostern) since they are quite new. So at some future game session, I'll just announce it has succeeded.<br /> <br /> So my goal is to have something appropriate and evocative that helps establish in their minds what the Garou are like. I am still trying to show them what Garou are like and how their society is different from humans. There is nothing I really need done - and if I do, I obviously want to save that for the players. If somehow, the resolution of the challenge could somehow create plot for the PCs that would be a nice side benefit.<br /> <br /> So Asmodai's examples are good for me. But just case it inspires other contributions, here is a brief synopsis of the sept.<br /> <br /> It is a Caern of Harmony. It's in what used to be a wilderness, but is now a protected park/forest on the edge of a major metropolitan city. Lots of people visit there so there are ongoing concerns about the Caern. In that respect, it is just a bigger and more wooded version of the Central Park Sept of the Green.<br /> <br /> The sept tribes are Silver Fangs and Get of Fenris. They reluctantly allowed Glass Walkers to join in the past several decades because their kinfolk saved the forest from being developed. The two &quot;rural&quot; tribes though are terrified that the sept will be seen as an &quot;urban caern&quot; with the loss of prestige and reputation. They see it as a caern set against the city. The Glass Walkers naturally see it as part of the city community and see benefits of how it can &quot;green&quot; the city environment. The city also has a group of Bone Gnawers that are not allowed access to the caern unless they agree to a whole set of humiliating restrictions. So the Bone Gnawers don't attend the sept, if they ever need to do anything like that, they have to travel to another city and access the Bone Gnawer caern there. So that is local politics.<br /> <br /> There are no current pressing concerns or plot points that need addressing; just the typical backdrop of the setting that explains what the NPC Garou are doing while I run the game for the PCs.<br /> <br /> At this point in time the PCs are still young enough Cliath that no one gives them much thought. They've done some good things, and done some bad things/screw ups - but they are Cliath, that's what they do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}